   243	| V8 | fixture content hash and a fresh scope id are recorded |
   244	| V9 | raw results were retained and hashed before any assertion |
   245	| V10 | executed count equals declared count; skipped, unsupported and not-implemented are all 0; errors only where a case expects them |
