     1	# Capability matrix (skeleton)
     2	
     3	Version 0.1.0-draft, 2026-11-07, EXP-A01. Closure rule CR-MATRIX in `ACCEPTANCE.md` reads this file through
     4	obligation `R.raw.capability-required-cells`; `G10.capabilities.truthful` requires the advertised capability set
     5	to equal the EXACT rows.
     6	
     7	## How to read it
     8	
     9	- **Rows** are operator and value-type pairs. **Columns** are surface by engine and language.
    10	- **Surfaces.** `repo` = entity repository. `frag` = supported native fragment (helpers from the lane's native
    11	  context, inside their stated equivalence conditions). `raw` = unrestricted raw query over the documented raw
    12	  dataset (EP-RAW-HATCH and EP-RAW-WIRE).
    13	- **Cell values.** Only two values exist in this version:
    14	  - `OPEN`: no acceptance receipt yet. A note in brackets says what source reading or a probe suggests; that is
    15	    not evidence of exactness.
    16	  - `KL-n`: KNOWN-LIMIT, a documented engine or driver behavior that breaks the required exactness, with the
    17	    evidence linked below. A cell becomes `EXACT` only with a passing acceptance receipt.
    18	- **Required exactness** says what the cell must deliver to count as EXACT: `exact` (bit-exact or
    19	  codepoint-exact), `exact-or-error` (exact inside the domain, typed error outside it, never a wrong value),
    20	  `spec` (the SPARQL 1.1 or SQL semantics named in O-SHAPE or O-ERR).
    21	- **Required by.** Obligations whose closure needs this cell EXACT on the listed surfaces. A KNOWN-LIMIT cell
    22	  with a non-empty required-by list keeps those obligations OPEN until a repair (another implementation or an
    23	  engine repair) makes it EXACT. Rejecting the shape does not count.
    24	- The XTDB repository column is shared by both XTDB lanes.
    25	
    26	## Matrix
    27	
    28	X = xtdb-xtql, S = xtdb-sql, Q = qlever-sparql.
    29	
    30	| # | Operator | Type or band | Required exactness | X raw | X frag | S raw | S frag | Q raw | Q frag | repo XTDB | repo QLever | Required by (surfaces) |
    31	| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
    32	| 1 | `=` filter | text | exact | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | R.raw.parity (raw), R.repo.entity-suite (repo) |
    33	| 2 | `=` filter | int64, \|v\| <= 2^53 | exact | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | OPEN | R.raw.parity, G1.types.eight-type-roundtrip |
